{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "161b5af16eb60c1728b9d1e2d88b8cf48ed2fba64726d776bb13abdf414594c7", "ja": "（今日は亜美と真美のPV撮影。……だが、さっきから\n亜美の姿が見えない。いったいどこへ……）", "zh": "（今天是亚美和真美的PV拍摄……可是从刚才开始就一直看不到亚美的身影。她到底去哪儿了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "cd1e4b82366b8182e29693056f6e4da0564e7dffc3685baea4ab694b61cdd59d", "ja": "にーちゃーんっ、たっだいまーーーーっ！！！", "zh": "哥哥——！我回来啦————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c485977d4c0d91950cc44962c375035afe2d3f49a70de20f8360b8e2a43cc45a", "ja": "ぐはあっ！！", "zh": "咕哈啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "5c811dc356680e2b45afc95de29c13c44175253885839cef3a8a05cf0847b358", "ja": "あれ、兄ちゃんダイジョーブ？\nもっとタイカン鍛えたほうがいいよ！", "zh": "咦，哥哥没事吧？\n你还是多锻炼锻炼体魄比较好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d2c656f3dd6b7b5098fd2300feed7f0aa0776c5504c71f058ce9cd9e76f06fa7", "ja": "そうだな、最近ちょっと運動不足で……じゃなくて！\n突然激突されたら、誰だってよろけるだろ。", "zh": "确实，最近有点缺乏运动……不对！突然被撞上来，换谁都会站不稳吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "77b5e193eb64fd90d784b524a7d7f3dac0744ebfd3cd623faf9c77bdccfc0b60", "ja": "まるでロケットみたいな帰還だな……\nとりあえず撮影に間に合ってよかったよ。", "zh": "简直像火箭一样返回了啊……\n总之，能赶上拍摄真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "1d7f1143bbe3a0e421abedce4228aefdd006890be634e47f2c0c74c7ec644b49", "ja": "ロケット？　ブッブー、残念！\n正解は『流れ星』でしたー！", "zh": "火箭？错——很遗憾！\n正确答案是“流星”——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c0aa67e28c01ef8f0b51206c2ebacf77ef8b1a074876b2875c339bddc51c82f0", "ja": "流れ星か～、残念！　って、クイズだったのか……。\nそれより、どこに行ってたんだ？　もうすぐ本番だぞ。", "zh": "是流星啊～真遗憾！等等，原来是猜谜啊……\n先不说这个，你刚才去哪儿了？马上就要正式演出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "992892417d898972793ca2c198b5355d05c47235850b4cc75e21994d10ce04ae", "ja": "んっとね、スタジオの屋上！　今日は星がよく見えそう\nって、さっきスタッフさんが言ってたからね！", "zh": "嗯——是在摄影棚的屋顶！刚才工作人员说，今天应该能看见很多星星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ab3eb4f33f3460e60ac84604bb5868f67c9f8627ab172f3af657175ff7ddf787", "ja": "ああ、もう外は暗くなる時間か……\n流れ星は見つかったか？", "zh": "啊，外面已经到天黑的时候了啊……\n找到流星了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "735ae1a3889355492f006233509138c613478452ad6966db79f1e645721132b1", "ja": "もちろん！　ちゃんとふたつ、見つけたよ！\n願い事もしっかりダブルでしてきたかんね！", "zh": "当然啦！亚美好好找到了两颗呢！\n愿望也特地许了双份哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "8ca3d202229cd9b897e525da1ea70343335b40ca1c19f41feab2c57a89e39dd4", "ja": "この前出会ったツインズが、亜美たちみたいに\n毎日、楽しくシアワセに過ごせますように～って！", "zh": "希望之前遇到的那对双胞胎，也能像亚美我们一样，每天都开心幸福地生活～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ba344a37b404e4fd2bd41b5e7d061087f53cf809a5c9fde3f6f7b93fcfe3fa63", "ja": "ん、ツインズ？", "zh": "嗯，双胞胎？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "83bc6ddaf5b274c90d31a771c3f67442997f580335e004e784e0a08e55f478c6", "ja": "こないだ真美と一緒に散歩してたらね、\n泣いてる双子のベイビーズに出会ったんだ～。", "zh": "前些天我和真美一起散步时啊，遇到了一对正在哭的双胞胎宝宝～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "d777d7466abad1e8ce7aa4192e32d107145c2e440b45b9c213cc30b6118e0047", "ja": "でさ、亜美たちがあやしてあげたんだけど……\nふたりを見てたら、ムカシを思い出したんだよね。", "zh": "然后呢，亚美她们哄了哄那两个孩子……看着他们，亚美就想起以前的事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "c347c7c409ef29c2d1cc507d016cf40035e6aa327f9b67ad942b56b0cebb2350", "ja": "亜美たちにも、かつては、あんな小さくおさない\n時代があったな～と、しみじみ……。", "zh": "我们以前也有过那么年幼稚嫩的时期呢～不禁感慨万分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1016_p", "source_sha256": "10af2780d4b89b4780e336fdfb21bd3c5de1b9eca9dcae10bdac052bfffb5cb1", "ja": "しみじみ述懐するほど昔ってわけでもない\nような……けど、そうか。ふたりの幸せをな。", "zh": "也没到需要感慨追忆的那么久以前吧……\n不过，也是啊。祝她们两个幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "5c571a74d3a20afb2dedc16ef1d1cbcb9506d7785237997d854b99e7e41fca30", "ja": "うむ。たまに涙するようなことがあったとしても、\n共に生まれた運命の双子ならではの、シアワセをね。", "zh": "嗯。即使偶尔会有令人落泪的事，也要拥有只有一起出生的命运双胞胎才有的幸福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "ce27bd9ca56e6f97802c59e15aa2da5538ff29d7129cd216e00309e2fd270591", "ja": "遊ぶにもイタズラするにも、一緒に過ごす\nその姉妹の楽しさは、1たす1ではないのだよ。", "zh": "不管是一起玩还是一起恶作剧，和那对姐妹一起度过的快乐，可不是1加1那么简单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "376cf88fb43c44a1e10bb30c3ea5ee8dfaf0d1636aff9cb4aa58bb17b7ab07e2", "ja": "可能性は2倍にあらず、大宇宙のスケール……あ、\nなんか難しい話になっちゃったけど兄ちゃんわかるー？", "zh": "可能性可不止2倍，而是有着大宇宙般的规模……啊，\n虽然好像说得有点复杂了，不过哥你能听懂吗——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fa710ff3568a799cd7ddb6c1ff018542791dbc14a5adcc29d2b90248f418dce5", "ja": "わからないけど、よくわかったぞ！\n……ん、そろそろ撮影開始だ、亜美。楽しんで行こう。", "zh": "虽然不明白，但我完全明白了！……嗯，差不多该开始拍摄了，亚美。我们开心地上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0204_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "4cbabee7408623473914402a88b79b1a1fc45c0144ce6d14c4b52abf3079a802", "ja": "うん！　よーし、待ってなよ真美……ふたりの\n気合いMAXで、すっごいPVにしちゃうかんね！", "zh": "嗯！好——等着吧，真美……就用我们俩MAX的干劲，把PV拍得超棒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
